---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AdSensePlaceholder from '../../../components/AdSensePlaceholder.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="AI自動レイヤー分割＆PSDエクスポート - GlowPunch" description="画像をAIが解析し、人物や背景などの要素ごとに自動でレイヤー分割。完全保存版のPSDデータとしてブラウザ完結で出力します。">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
    <div class="mb-4">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-800 tracking-tight mb-2">AI自動レイヤー分割＆<span class="text-sky-500">PSDエクスポート</span></h1>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg">画像をAIが被写体や背景などのパーツごとに自動分割し、PSD形式（レイヤー保持）でダウンロードできるツールです。お使いの端末内で処理が完結するため、外部へのデータ送信は一切ありません。</p>
    </div>

    <!-- UI Main Container -->
    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-6">
      
      <!-- Left side: Upload & Preview -->
      <div class="flex-grow flex flex-col gap-4">
        <!-- Dropzone -->
        <div id="dropzone" class="glass-panel p-8 rounded-2xl border-2 border-dashed border-slate-300 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center cursor-pointer hover:border-sky-400 hover:bg-sky-50/50 transition-all min-h-[160px]">
          <svg class="w-12 h-12 text-slate-400 mb-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-8l-4-4m0 0L8 8m4-4v12"></path>
          </svg>
          <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium text-lg">画像ファイルをドロップするか、<span class="text-sky-500 font-bold">クリックして選択</span></p>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-1">JPEG, PNG, WEBP対応</p>
          <input type="file" id="file-input" class="hidden" accept="image/jpeg, image/png, image/webp" />
        </div>

        <!-- Preview Area -->
        <div id="preview-container" class="hidden glass-panel p-4 rounded-2xl relative overflow-hidden bg-white">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-3">
            <h3 class="text-slate-700 font-bold">プレビュー (<span id="original-size"></span>)</h3>
            <button id="btn-reset" class="text-sm px-3 py-1 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-600 rounded-lg transition-colors">別の画像をアップロード</button>
          </div>
          
          <div id="canvas-wrapper" class="relative rounded shadow-inner overflow-hidden w-full bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 flex justify-center items-start" style="background-image: linear-gradient(45deg, #e5e5e5 25%, transparent 25%), linear-gradient(-45deg, #e5e5e5 25%, transparent 25%), linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 75%, #e5e5e5 75%), linear-gradient(-45deg, transparent 75%, #e5e5e5 75%); background-size: 20px 20px; background-position: 0 0, 0 10px, 10px -10px, -10px 0px; min-height: 200px;">
            <div class="relative max-w-full" style="display: inline-block;">
              <canvas id="orig-canvas" class="block max-w-full h-auto opacity-100 transition-opacity mx-auto" style="max-height: 70vh;"></canvas>
              <div id="layer-canvases" class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none">
                <!-- 抽出レイヤーのCanvasがここにposition:absoluteで積まれる -->
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Right side: Controls -->
      <div id="controls-panel" class="w-full lg:w-80 flex flex-col gap-4 opacity-50 pointer-events-none transition-opacity">
        <div class="glass-panel p-5 rounded-2xl">
          <h3 class="text-slate-700 font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-sky-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"></path></svg>
            処理メニュー
          </h3>
          <button id="btn-segment" class="w-full py-3 mb-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-white bg-sky-500 hover:bg-sky-600 active:scale-95 transition-all shadow shadow-sky-500/30 flex justify-center items-center gap-2">
            AIで要素ごとに分割
          </button>
          
          <!-- Progress -->
          <div id="progress-container" class="hidden mb-4">
            <div class="flex justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 mb-1">
              <span id="progress-status">モデルをロード中...</span>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full bg-slate-200 rounded-full h-2">
              <div id="progress-bar" class="bg-sky-500 h-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-300" style="width: 0%"></div>
            </div>
            <p id="progress-detail" class="text-xs text-sky-600 mt-1"></p>
          </div>

          <hr class="border-slate-200 my-4" />

          <h3 class="text-slate-700 font-bold mb-3">レイヤー構成</h3>
          <div id="layers-list" class="flex flex-col gap-2 max-h-60 overflow-y-auto mb-4 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-2 bg-slate-50/50">
            <div class="text-sm text-slate-400 text-center py-4">AI分割後にレイヤーが表示されます</div>
          </div>

          <button id="btn-export-psd" class="hidden w-full py-3 rounded-xl font-bold tracking-wide text-white bg-purple-500 hover:bg-purple-600 active:scale-95 transition-all shadow shadow-purple-500/30 justify-center items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 10v6m0 0l-3-3m3 3l3-3m2 8H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path></svg>
            PSDとして保存
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- SEO text -->
    <article class="prose prose-slate mt-16 max-w-none border-t border-slate-200 pt-10">
      <h2>ツールについて</h2>
      <p>このツールは、ブラウザに搭載された機械学習モデル（ONNX Runtime / Transformers.js）を利用し、画像内の要素（人物、壁、空、地面、建物など）を自動で認識して切り抜くツールです。すべての処理はあなたのブラウザの中だけで高速に行われるため、画像のアップロード不要で安全にお使いいただけます。</p>
      <h3>主な用途</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>画像から人物だけを切り抜いて別の背景に合成したい時</li>
        <li>風景画像から空の部分だけを分離したい時</li>
        <li>デザイン素材として細かくレイヤー分けされたPSDが欲しい時</li>
      </ul>
      <p>初回の分割時にはモデルデータ（数十MB）のダウンロードが走るため少し時間がかかりますが、2回目以降はオフラインに近い速度でサクサク動作します。</p>
    </article>
    
    <div class="mt-4">
      <AdSensePlaceholder slotId="ai-psd-exporter-bottom" />
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  import { writePsd } from 'ag-psd';
  import { removeBackground } from '@imgly/background-removal';

  // Elements
  const dropzone = document.getElementById('dropzone');
  const fileInput = document.getElementById('file-input');
  const previewContainer = document.getElementById('preview-container');
  const btnReset = document.getElementById('btn-reset');
  const origCanvas = document.getElementById('orig-canvas') as HTMLCanvasElement;
  const layerCanvasesContainer = document.getElementById('layer-canvases');
  const controlsPanel = document.getElementById('controls-panel');
  const btnSegment = document.getElementById('btn-segment');
  
  const progressContainer = document.getElementById('progress-container');
  const progressStatus = document.getElementById('progress-status');
  const progressBar = document.getElementById('progress-bar');
  const progressDetail = document.getElementById('progress-detail');
  
  const layersList = document.getElementById('layers-list');
  const btnExportPsd = document.getElementById('btn-export-psd');
  const originalSizeLabel = document.getElementById('original-size');

  let currentImageFile = null;
  let originalImage = new Image();
  let generatedLayers = []; 
  let isProcessing = false;

  // Handle Drag & Drop
  ['dragenter', 'dragover', 'dragleave', 'drop'].forEach(eventName => {
    dropzone?.addEventListener(eventName, preventDefaults, false);
  });

  function preventDefaults(e) {
    e.preventDefault();
    e.stopPropagation();
  }

  ['dragenter', 'dragover'].forEach(eventName => {
    dropzone?.addEventListener(eventName, () => {
      dropzone.classList.add('border-sky-500', 'bg-sky-50');
    }, false);
  });

  ['dragleave', 'drop'].forEach(eventName => {
    dropzone?.addEventListener(eventName, () => {
      dropzone.classList.remove('border-sky-500', 'bg-sky-50');
    }, false);
  });

  dropzone?.addEventListener('drop', (e) => {
    const dt = e.dataTransfer;
    const files = dt.files;
    handleFiles(files);
  }, false);

  dropzone?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    fileInput?.click();
  });

  fileInput?.addEventListener('change', function(this: HTMLInputElement) {
    if (this.files) handleFiles(this.files);
  });

  function handleFiles(files) {
    if (files.length === 0) return;
    const file = files[0];
    if (!file.type.startsWith('image/')) {
        alert('画像ファイルを選択してください');
        return;
    }
    
    currentImageFile = file;

    const reader = new FileReader();
    reader.onload = (e) => {
      loadImageForPreview(e.target?.result);
    };
    reader.readAsDataURL(file);
  }

  function loadImageForPreview(src) {
    originalImage.onload = () => {
      // Show Preview & Controls
      dropzone.classList.add('hidden');
      previewContainer.classList.remove('hidden');
      controlsPanel.classList.remove('opacity-50', 'pointer-events-none');
      
      const width = originalImage.width;
      const height = originalImage.height;
      originalSizeLabel.textContent = `${width}x${height}px`;

      origCanvas.width = width;
      origCanvas.height = height;
      const ctx = origCanvas.getContext('2d');
      ctx.drawImage(originalImage, 0, 0);

      // Reset previous layers
      layerCanvasesContainer.innerHTML = '';
      generatedLayers = [];
      btnSegment.disabled = false;
      btnSegment.innerHTML = 'AIで要素ごとに分割';
      progressContainer.classList.add('hidden');
      btnExportPsd.style.display = 'none';
      origCanvas.style.opacity = '1';
      layersList.innerHTML = '<div class="text-sm text-slate-400 text-center py-4">AI分割後にレイヤーが表示されます</div>';
      btnSegment.style.display = 'flex';
    };
    originalImage.src = src;
  }

  btnReset?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (isProcessing) return;
    currentImageFile = null;
    dropzone.classList.remove('hidden');
    previewContainer.classList.add('hidden');
    controlsPanel.classList.add('opacity-50', 'pointer-events-none');
    fileInput.value = '';
    btnExportPsd.classList.add('hidden');
    btnExportPsd.style.display = '';
  });

  btnSegment?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
    if (!currentImageFile || isProcessing) return;
    
    isProcessing = true;
    btnSegment.disabled = true;
    btnSegment.innerHTML = '<svg class="animate-spin -ml-1 mr-3 h-5 w-5 text-white inline flex-shrink-0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle class="opacity-25" cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"></circle><path class="opacity-75" fill="currentColor" d="M4 12a8 8 0 018-8V0C5.373 0 0 5.373 0 12h4zm2 5.291A7.962 7.962 0 014 12H0c0 3.042 1.135 5.824 3 7.938l3-2.647z"></path></svg> 処理中...';
    
    progressContainer.classList.remove('hidden');
    progressStatus.textContent = '初期化中...';
    progressBar.style.width = '0%';
    progressDetail.textContent = '';
    
    try {
        const config = {
          progress: (key: string, current: number, total: number) => {
             const percent = Math.min(100, Math.round((current / total) * 100));
             progressBar.style.width = `${percent}%`;
             progressDetail.textContent = percent + '%';
             if (key.includes('model_')) {
                progressStatus.textContent = `ONNXモデルをロード中...`;
             } else if (key.includes('compute')) {
                progressStatus.textContent = `推論を実行中...`;
             }
          }
        };

        const fgBlob = await removeBackground(currentImageFile, config);
        const fgUrl = URL.createObjectURL(fgBlob);
        
        progressStatus.textContent = 'レイヤーを構築中...';
        
        const fgImg = new Image();
        fgImg.onload = () => {
            processSegmentationResult(fgImg);
            URL.revokeObjectURL(fgUrl);
        };
        fgImg.src = fgUrl;

    } catch(err) {
        alert(`エラーが発生しました: ${err.message}`);
        isProcessing = false;
        btnSegment.disabled = false;
        btnSegment.innerHTML = '再試行する';
        progressContainer.classList.add('hidden');
        console.error(err);
    }
  });

  function processSegmentationResult(fgImg) {
    origCanvas.style.opacity = '0.05'; 
    layerCanvasesContainer.innerHTML = '';
    layersList.innerHTML = '';
    generatedLayers = [];

    const tempCanvas = document.createElement('canvas');
    tempCanvas.width = originalImage.width;
    tempCanvas.height = originalImage.height;
    const ctx = tempCanvas.getContext('2d');
    ctx.drawImage(originalImage, 0, 0);
    const origData = ctx.getImageData(0, 0, originalImage.width, originalImage.height);

    const fgCanvasSource = document.createElement('canvas');
    fgCanvasSource.width = originalImage.width;
    fgCanvasSource.height = originalImage.height;
    const fgCtx = fgCanvasSource.getContext('2d');
    fgCtx.drawImage(fgImg, 0, 0, originalImage.width, originalImage.height);
    const resolvedFgData = fgCtx.getImageData(0, 0, originalImage.width, originalImage.height);
    
    const fgImageData = new ImageData(originalImage.width, originalImage.height);
    const bgImageData = new ImageData(originalImage.width, originalImage.height);

    for (let i = 0; i < origData.data.length; i += 4) {
        const maskAlpha = resolvedFgData.data[i+3]; 
        
        // 主役（Foreground）
        fgImageData.data[i] = origData.data[i];
        fgImageData.data[i+1] = origData.data[i+1];
        fgImageData.data[i+2] = origData.data[i+2];
        fgImageData.data[i+3] = maskAlpha; 
        
        // 背景（Background）- マスクの反転
        bgImageData.data[i] = origData.data[i];
        bgImageData.data[i+1] = origData.data[i+1];
        bgImageData.data[i+2] = origData.data[i+2];
        bgImageData.data[i+3] = 255 - maskAlpha; 
    }

    // Background Canvas
    const bgCanvas = document.createElement('canvas');
    bgCanvas.width = originalImage.width;
    bgCanvas.height = originalImage.height;
    bgCanvas.className = 'absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-contain';
    bgCanvas.getContext('2d').putImageData(bgImageData, 0, 0);
    layerCanvasesContainer.appendChild(bgCanvas);
    const bgObj = { name: '背景 (Background)', canvas: bgCanvas, visible: true };
    generatedLayers.push(bgObj);
    addLayerUIControl(bgObj);
    
    // Foreground Canvas
    const fgCanvas = document.createElement('canvas');
    fgCanvas.width = originalImage.width;
    fgCanvas.height = originalImage.height;
    fgCanvas.className = 'absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-contain';
    fgCanvas.getContext('2d').putImageData(fgImageData, 0, 0);
    layerCanvasesContainer.appendChild(fgCanvas);
    const fgObj = { name: '主役 (Foreground)', canvas: fgCanvas, visible: true };
    generatedLayers.push(fgObj);
    addLayerUIControl(fgObj);
    
    progressStatus.textContent = '完了しました！';
    isProcessing = false;
    btnSegment.style.display = 'none';

    btnExportPsd.classList.remove('hidden');
    btnExportPsd.classList.add('flex');
    btnExportPsd.style.display = 'flex';
  }

  function addLayerUIControl(layerObj) {
    const wrap = document.createElement('div');
    wrap.className = 'flex items-center justify-between p-2 rounded bg-white border border-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors shadow-sm';
    
    const eyeBtn = document.createElement('button');
    eyeBtn.className = 'p-1 text-slate-500 hover:text-sky-500 transition-colors focus:outline-none';
    eyeBtn.innerHTML = `<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12s3-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3 7-10 7-10-7-10-7Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>`;
    
    const eyeOffIcon = `<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9.88 9.88a3 3 0 1 0 4.24 4.24"/><path d="M10.73 5.08A10.43 10.43 0 0 1 12 5c7 0 10 7 10 7a13.16 13.16 0 0 1-1.67 2.68"/><path d="M6.61 6.61A13.526 13.526 0 0 0 2 12s3 7 10 7a9.74 9.74 0 0 0 5.39-1.61"/><line x1="2" x2="22" y1="2" y2="22"/></svg>`;
    const eyeOnIcon = eyeBtn.innerHTML;

    eyeBtn.onclick = () => {
        layerObj.visible = !layerObj.visible;
        layerObj.canvas.style.opacity = layerObj.visible ? '1' : '0';
        eyeBtn.innerHTML = layerObj.visible ? eyeOnIcon : eyeOffIcon;
        eyeBtn.classList.toggle('text-slate-300', !layerObj.visible);
    };

    const label = document.createElement('span');
    label.className = 'text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 capitalize w-full text-left px-2 truncate';
    label.textContent = layerObj.name;
    
    const thumb = document.createElement('img');
    thumb.className = 'w-8 h-8 object-contain bg-slate-100 rounded border border-slate-200';
    
    // thumbnail scale down for performance
    const thumbCanvas = document.createElement('canvas');
    const tbCtx = thumbCanvas.getContext('2d');
    thumbCanvas.width = 120;
    thumbCanvas.height = 120;
    const sRatio = Math.min(120 / layerObj.canvas.width, 120 / layerObj.canvas.height);
    const sW = layerObj.canvas.width * sRatio;
    const sH = layerObj.canvas.height * sRatio;
    tbCtx.drawImage(layerObj.canvas, (120 - sW)/2, (120 - sH)/2, sW, sH);
    thumb.src = thumbCanvas.toDataURL('image/png', 0.5); 
    
    wrap.appendChild(eyeBtn);
    wrap.appendChild(label);
    wrap.appendChild(thumb);
    
    layersList.appendChild(wrap);
  }

  btnExportPsd?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (generatedLayers.length === 0) return;
      
      const originalBtnText = btnExportPsd.innerHTML;
      btnExportPsd.innerHTML = 'PSDを生成中...';
      btnExportPsd.disabled = true;
      
      setTimeout(() => {
          try {
              const children = generatedLayers.map(l => ({
                  name: l.name,
                  canvas: l.canvas,
                  hidden: !l.visible
              }));
              
              const psdConfig = {
                  width: originalImage.width,
                  height: originalImage.height,
                  children: children
              };
              
              const buffer = writePsd(psdConfig);
              const blob = new Blob([buffer], { type: 'application/octet-stream' });
              const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
              const a = document.createElement('a');
              a.href = url;
              a.download = `segmented_image_${Date.now()}.psd`;
              a.click();
              
              setTimeout(() => { URL.revokeObjectURL(url); }, 1000);
          } catch (e) {
              console.error(e);
              alert('PSDの生成に失敗しました: ' + e.message);
          } finally {
              btnExportPsd.innerHTML = originalBtnText;
              btnExportPsd.disabled = false;
          }
      }, 100);
  });
</script>
